# hotel-demand-powerbi: files that must never be committed.
# See docs/PLAN.md P0-02 and docs/RISKS-AND-OPEN-QUESTIONS.md R01, R03, R04.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. The dataset is never committed. Keep it in data/.
# data/lookup/ stays tracked for small hand-written lookups (P1-15).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/lookup/
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Power BI. The project is kept as PBIP text; a PBIX holds data.
# The two .pbi patterns are the ones Desktop writes into its own
# .gitignore (docs/LEARN-SOURCES.md S02). Desktop does not write
# its own file when one already exists, so they must be here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.pbix
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
*.abf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor clutter
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
~$*
*.tmp
.vscode/
